      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seconded. The sync state of objects isn't being triggered when they are moved via joint, script, physics, or anything that doesn't involve direct contact by the player.\n\nThis can be tested in my public Game of Kings world. The chess pieces sync up properly when picked up by the player, but when moved using the remote control staves, they do not sync. This also happens with the pullup benches which have the handle connected to the bench via a physics joint.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
