      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After some followup testing, it seems like this bug also affects some of the vehicles constructs. Specifically the gokarts from Toad Harbour, the jetpacks from Twindrive Testrun, and any other vehicles based off of those two such as the Oban Star Racers and the Starfox Arwings.  Movements appear very erratic to outside observers and often don't sync at all.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
